      "name": "IOPaint",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "自托管的 AI 图像修复与扩图工具：对已有图片做擦除、替换、扩图与局部重绘，并在 Web UI 中检查与保存结果；上游仓库已归档、只读。",
      "homepage": "https://www.iopaint.com/",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/Sanster/IOPaint",
      "github_repository_id": 428292281,
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Sanster/IOPaint/license",
      "features": [
        "擦除模型去除物体、瑕疵、水印与人物",
        "扩散模型替换物体、局部重绘（inpainting）与扩图（outpainting）",
        "内置 Web UI，可在 FileManager 中浏览图片并保存到输出目录",
        "支持 CPU / GPU / Apple Silicon 自托管运行"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "pip 安装后本地启动 Web UI（默认 8080 端口）",
        "Windows 一键安装包；模型首次启动自动下载"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Python"
      ],
